NOTE ON THE TRAINING DATA

The datasets under `data/` are derived from digitized editions of classical
Arabic hadith collections. The underlying works are centuries old and in the
public domain. The particular digitizations and modern critical editions from
which the text was harvested may carry editorial rights in some
jurisdictions; the excerpts here are short, non-contiguous windows retained
for research and reproducibility. See `docs/DATA.md` for provenance details.
If you intend to redistribute the datasets commercially, review the position
of the source editions in your own jurisdiction.
